		<section>
			<div class="grid">
				<div class="row resources">
					<div class="col-12-xs col-12-sm col-8-md col-9">
						<div class="res">
							<h1>Search API</h1>
							<p>Easily embed web search capability into any website or application using the <a href="/services/search/web-search-api/">Mojeek Search API</a>.</p>
							<p>If you are a larger organisation or have multiple websites you might like to check out Mojeek's <a href="/support/api/orgse/">Organisation Search API</a>.</p>
							<h2>Search API Documentation</h2>
							<ul>
								<li><p><a href="/support/api/search/quickstart.html">Quickstart</a></p></li>
								<li><p><a href="/support/api/search/request_parameters.html">Request Parameters</a></p></li>
								<li><p><a href="/support/api/search/results_scoring.html">Results Scoring Parameters</a></p></li>
								<li><p><a href="/support/api/search/json_response.html">JSON Response Format</a></p></li>
								<li><p><a href="/support/api/search/xml_response.html">XML Response Format</a></p></li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="col-12-xs col-12-sm col-4-md col-3 res-sticky">
						<div class="res-menu">
							<ul>
